OL,3,GNEWSARoad cordoned after man barricades
OL,4,Ahimself in house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has locked himself in a house and
OL,7,Fmade threats to harm anyone who
OL,8,Fentered, police said.
OL,10,FNorfolk Police was called to a property
OL,11,Fon Coast Road, Hopton-on-Sea, near
OL,12,FGreat Yarmouth, shortly after 11.30 GMT
OL,13,Ffollowing reports a man had made
OL,14,Fthreats when attempts were made to
OL,15,Fevict him from a house.
OL,17,FHopton Church of England Primary
OL,18,FAcademy was evacuated in response to
OL,19,Fthe situation, and the county council
OL,20,Fadvised it would remain closed on
OL,21,FThursday "as a precautionary measure".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
